<title>ESTONIA: LEKS SHARE EMISSION PRICE AT 38 KROONS: REPORT.</title>
<headline>LEKS SHARE EMISSION PRICE AT 38 KROONS: REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leks Insurance's share emission will take place from April 21 to May 5 with the share price fixed at 38 kroons, Aripaev said on Monday.</p>
<p>Leks Insurance will issue eight million kroons of shares with two million going to Tallinna Pank , two million kroons of shares for public emission and four million kroons of shares for possible purchase by Leks employees, the business daily said.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
